[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32100100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32100100_03_0010","text":"只是设计图而已\n又不是实物"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32100100_03_0020","text":"不是实物"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32100100_03_0030","text":"话是这么说……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32100100_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32100100_03_0040","text":"……不，你说得对\n抱歉，我想太多了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32100100_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32100100_03_0050","text":"还有，刚才试戴的配饰\n有喜欢的可以带回去"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32100100_03_0060","text":"诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32100100_03_0070","text":"据说没用上的会处理掉\n蝴蝶胸针、蝴蝶耳环、蝴蝶项链──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32100100_03_0080","text":"……说是喜欢的话就拿走"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32100100_03_0090","text":"谢谢\n……那我收下了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32100100_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32100100_03_0093","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32100100_03_0092","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32100100_03_0100","text":"如果有蝴蝶以外的"}]
